# Cross-platform line-ending policy (Windows authoring → Linux CI).
# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository so diffs are deterministic and the
# schema codegen-diff CI job (`git diff --exit-code -- packages/schemas/generated/`)
# cannot flap red if a contributor regenerates on Windows with core.autocrlf=true.
# All tracked files are already LF, so this introduces no renormalization churn.
* text=auto eol=lf
